  "contentPreview": "judge-replay CANNOT RUN OFFLINE, despite being designed to. Found 2026-08-20 while acting on the ParseGrade fix from [[complexity-review-2026-08-20]].  JudgeReplayCommand.RunAsync calls RetrieverFactory.BuildJudgeAsync -\u003E AgentClientBuilder.BuildAsync, which at line ~127 runs \u0060bool available = await llm.IsAvailableAsync(ct);\u0060 and THROWS InvalidOperationException when the endpoint is unreachable. This happens BEFORE any cache lookup.  So replay refuses to start without a live inference endpoint e",
